message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sovereign Ops: Domain-Aware Reliability and Abstention for Mission-Critical Telemetry"
authors:
  - family-names: Pereira
    given-names: Rodolfo
    orcid: ""
    affiliation: "ShockBridge Pulse Research Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/sovereign-ops-2.0"
url: "https://shockbridgepulse.com"
abstract: >-
  Research software for domain-aware reliability and abstention on
  historical spacecraft and wind-turbine telemetry. Implements a shared
  governance layer — typed contracts, explicit abstention vocabulary,
  cryptographic source provenance, and confirmatory evaluation protocol —
  across physically distinct domains while preserving domain-specific
  models and event definitions.
keywords:
  - anomaly-detection
